    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d508">

                <pb facs="0780" n="678" sameAs="frus:frus1933v01/pg678"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">550.S1/1086: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to President Roosevelt
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1933-07-03T10:00:00-04:00">July 3, 1933—10
                            a.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>38. Your 20, July 2, 10 p.m. Secretary Hull telephoned this morning that he
                    issued at 10:45 a.m., London time, the statement from you transmitted in your
                    19, July 2, 6 p.m.</p>
                <pb facs="0781" n="679" xml:id="pg679"/>
                <p>He decided that it would be inadvisable to add anything thereto and therefore has
                    not issued his proposed statement as Secretary of State which was transmitted to
                    you in the Department’s No. 37, July 2, 4 p.m.<anchor n="13" xml:id="d508-f1"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Carr</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d508-f1" n="13" xml:id="d508-f1-content">
                <p>See telegram No. 88, July 2, 8 p.m., from the Chairman of the American
                    delegation, <ref target="#pg674">p. 674</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
